<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_document" style="font-size:173%;">Generalizable Hierarchical Skill Learning via Object-Centric Representation
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
